//! What the calling family's operations hold beyond their operands.

import emit.keys (Callee)

/// `EntryValue` is the unit's one closure over a root's entry, taking `arity` arguments (a definition
/// named as a value); `ConstantRead` what a pure definition of no parameters answers, run once and
/// kept by the unit; `BuiltinValue` a builtin named as a value; `Ticked` the step a body run in place
/// of a call counts.
pub type CallingOp =
  | EntryValue({ callee: Callee, arity: Int })
  | ConstantRead(Callee)
  | BuiltinValue(Bytes)
  | Ticked
